    {"artifact.jewel.01", "It sustains your strength, intelligence and dexterity.", "它能维持你的力量、智力和敏捷。", ""},
    {"artifact.jewel.02", "It may teleport you next to monsters.", "它可能将你传送到怪物身旁。", ""},
    {"artifact.jewel.03", "It can be evoked for teleport control.", "它可以主动发动以控制传送。", ""},
    {"artifact.jewel.04", "It allows you to eat raw meat even when not hungry.", "即使不饿，它也允许你食用生肉。", ""},
    {"artifact.jewel.05", "It increases damage dealt and taken.", "它会同时提高你造成和承受的伤害。", ""},
    {"artifact.jewel.06", "It protects your inventory from destruction.", "它能保护你的物品栏免遭摧毁。", ""},
    {"artifact.jewel.07", "It allows you to control your flight when levitating.", "它能让你在悬浮时控制飞行。", ""},
    {"artifact.jewel.08", "It reduces the accuracy of all your attacks.", "它会降低你所有攻击的命中率。", ""},
    {"artifact.jewel.09", "It causes incoming damage to be divided between your reserves of health and magic.", "受到伤害时，它会将伤害分摊到你的生命和魔力储备。", ""},
    {"artifact.jewel.10", "It allows you to gain divine favour quickly.", "它能让你迅速获得神恩。", ""},
    {"artifact.jewel.11", "It reflects blocked missile attacks.", "它会反弹被格挡的远程攻击。", ""},
    {"artifact.jewel.12", "It improves your skill with shapeshifting (+5).", "它会使你的变形术技能提高（+5）。", ""},
    {"artifact.jewel.13", "It restores some MP whenever you drink a potion and also enhances your alchemy spells.", "每当你喝下药水，它都会恢复一些魔力，并强化你的炼金术法术。", ""},
    {"artifact.jewel.14", "It reduces the duration of hostile enchantments and decays magical contamination more quickly.", "它会缩短敌对附魔的持续时间，并加快魔法污染消退。", ""},
    {"artifact.property.acrobat", "It increases your evasion after moving or waiting.", "移动或等待后，它会提高你的闪避。", ""},
    {"artifact.property.angry", "It berserks you when you make melee attacks ({chance}% chance).", "你进行近战攻击时有{chance}%的几率陷入狂暴。", "chance:integer"},
    {"artifact.property.archmagi", "It increases the power of your magical spells.", "它能提高你的法术威力。", ""},
