    {"item.gizmo.spellmotor.fixed", "Your spells cost less MP as you Rev up. Whenever you cast a spell, you make a melee attack against a random enemy in range.", "随着你提高转速，施法消耗的魔力会减少。每次施法时，你还会对射程内的一名随机敌人发动近战攻击。", ""},
    {"item.god.disapproval", "\n\n{god} disapproves of the use of such an item.", "\n\n{god}不赞成使用此物品。", "god:name"},
    {"item.hints.ability.prerequisite.armour", "To do this, first {equip_key}ear it, then enter the ability menu with {ability_key}, and then choose the corresponding ability. Note that such an attempt of activation, especially by the untrained, is likely to fail.", "要发动能力，先按{equip_key}穿上该护甲，再按{ability_key}打开能力菜单并选择相应能力。请注意，尝试发动能力很可能失败，尤其是尚未熟练时。", "equip_key:key_markup;ability_key:key_markup"},
    {"item.hints.ability.prerequisite.bug", "To do this, <r>(BUG! this item shouldn't give an ability)</r>, then enter the ability menu with {ability_key}, and then choose the corresponding ability. Note that such an attempt of activation, especially by the untrained, is likely to fail.", "要发动能力，<r>（错误：此物品不应提供能力）</r>，再按{ability_key}打开能力菜单并选择相应能力。请注意，尝试发动能力很可能失败，尤其是尚未熟练时。", "ability_key:key_markup"},
    {"item.hints.ability.prerequisite.equipped", "To do this, enter the ability menu with {ability_key}, and then choose the corresponding ability. Note that such an attempt of activation, especially by the untrained, is likely to fail.", "要发动能力，按{ability_key}打开能力菜单并选择相应能力。请注意，尝试发动能力很可能失败，尤其是尚未熟练时。", "ability_key:key_markup"},
    {"item.hints.ability.prerequisite.jewellery", "To do this, first {equip_key}ut it on, then enter the ability menu with {ability_key}, and then choose the corresponding ability. Note that such an attempt of activation, especially by the untrained, is likely to fail.", "要发动能力，先按{equip_key}戴上该饰品，再按{ability_key}打开能力菜单并选择相应能力。请注意，尝试发动能力很可能失败，尤其是尚未熟练时。", "equip_key:key_markup;ability_key:key_markup"},
    {"item.hints.ability.prerequisite.weapon", "To do this, first {equip_key}ield it, then enter the ability menu with {ability_key}, and then choose the corresponding ability. Note that such an attempt of activation, especially by the untrained, is likely to fail.", "要发动能力，先按{equip_key}挥舞该武器，再按{ability_key}打开能力菜单并选择相应能力。请注意，尝试发动能力很可能失败，尤其是尚未熟练时。", "equip_key:key_markup;ability_key:key_markup"},
    {"item.hints.armour.ability", "When worn, some types of armour (such as this one) offer certain {ability_key}bilities you can activate. {ability_hint}", "某些护甲（例如这件）穿戴后会提供可发动的能力（按{ability_key}进入能力菜单）。{ability_hint}", "ability_key:key_markup;ability_hint:text"},
    {"item.hints.armour.barding_restriction", "Only nagas and armataurs can wear barding.", "只有娜迦和半人马兽可以穿戴马铠。", ""},
    {"item.hints.armour.horns_helmet", "Because of your horns you cannot wear helmets. (Press {mutations_key} to see a list of your mutations and innate abilities.)", "因为你长有角，无法佩戴头盔。（按{mutations_key}可查看突变和先天能力列表。）", "mutations_key:key_markup"},
    {"item.hints.armour.magic_encumbrance", "Note that body armour with a high encumbrance rating may hinder your ability to cast spells. Light armour such as robes and leather armour will be generally safe for any aspiring spellcaster.", "注意，负重等级较高的躯干护甲可能妨碍施法。长袍、皮甲等轻甲通常不会影响有志施法者。", ""},
    {"item.hints.armour.magic_shield", "Note that shields will hinder your ability to cast spells, until you've gained enough Shields skill to remove the penalty.", "注意，在盾牌技能足以消除惩罚前，盾牌会妨碍你施法。", ""},
    {"item.hints.armour.ranger_offhand", "Note that many ranged weapons are two handed and so cannot be used with an offhand item.", "注意，许多远程武器需要双手使用，因此无法与副手物品同时装备。", ""},
    {"item.hints.armour.resistance", "This armour offers its wearer protection from certain sources. For an overview of your resistances (among other things) press {resists_key}{tile_control}.", "这件护甲能保护穿戴者免受某些伤害来源影响。按{resists_key}{tile_control}可查看抗性等信息。", "resists_key:key_markup;tile_control:text"},
    {"item.hints.armour.unidentified_special", "Weapons and armour that have unusual descriptions like this are much more likely to be of higher enchantment or have special properties, good or bad.", "描述异常的武器和护甲更有可能具有较高的附魔等级或特殊属性，无论好坏。", ""},
    {"item.hints.armour.wear_remove", "You can wear pieces of armour with {wear_key} and take them off again with {remove_key}{tile_alternative}.", "按{wear_key}可穿戴护甲，按{remove_key}可脱下{tile_alternative}。", "wear_key:key_markup;remove_key:key_markup;tile_alternative:text"},
    {"item.hints.book.manual", "A manual can greatly help you in training a skill. After you pick one up, the skill in question will be trained more efficiently and will level up faster until you exhaust the manual's contents.", "技能手册能显著帮助你训练技能。拾取后，对应技能的训练效率会提高、升级也会更快，直到手册内容耗尽。", ""},
    {"item.hints.book.spellbook", "You can pick up a spellbook to add its spells to your spell library. (View your spell library with {memorise_key}.)", "拾取法术书即可将其中的法术加入法术库。（按{memorise_key}查看法术库。）", "memorise_key:key_markup"},
    {"item.hints.corpse.use", "Skeletons and corpses can be used as components for certain necromantic spells. Apart from that, they are largely useless.", "骨骼和尸体可作为某些死灵法术的材料。除此之外，它们基本没有用处。", ""},
    {"item.hints.english_fallback", "{text}", "{text}", "text:text"},
    {"item.hints.jewellery.ability", "When worn, some types of jewellery (such as this one) offer certain {ability_key}bilities you can activate. {ability_hint}", "某些饰品（例如这件）戴上后会提供可发动的能力（按{ability_key}进入能力菜单）。{ability_hint}", "ability_key:key_markup;ability_hint:text"},
    {"item.hints.jewellery.resistance", "This {jewellery_type} offers its wearer protection from certain sources. For an overview of your resistances (among other things) press {resists_key}{tile_control}.", "这枚{jewellery_type}能保护佩戴者免受某些伤害来源影响。按{resists_key}{tile_control}可查看抗性等信息。", "jewellery_type:name;resists_key:key_markup;tile_control:text"},
    {"item.hints.jewellery.type.amulet", "amulet", "护身符", ""},
    {"item.hints.jewellery.type.ring", "ring", "戒指", ""},
    {"item.hints.jewellery.wear_remove", "Jewellery can be {wear_key}ut on or {remove_key}emoved again{tile_alternative}.", "按{wear_key}可戴上饰品，按{remove_key}可取下{tile_alternative}。", "wear_key:key_markup;remove_key:key_markup;tile_alternative:text"},
    {"item.hints.misc.evocation", "Miscellaneous items sometimes harbour magical powers that can be harnessed by e{evoke_key}oking the item.", "杂项物品有时蕴藏魔力，可按{evoke_key}发动。", "evoke_key:key_markup"},
    {"item.hints.missile.throwable", "{item_name} can be {fire_key}ired without the use of a launcher. {throw_hint}", "{item_name}无需发射器即可按{fire_key}发射。{throw_hint}", "item_name:name;fire_key:key_markup;throw_hint:text"},
    {"item.hints.potion.use", "Press {quaff_key} to quaff this potion{tile_click}.", "按{quaff_key}饮用这瓶药水{tile_click}。", "quaff_key:key_markup;tile_click:text"},
    {"item.hints.scroll.use", "Press {read_key} to read this scroll{tile_click}.", "按{read_key}阅读这张卷轴{tile_click}。", "read_key:key_markup;tile_click:text"},
    {"item.hints.staff.resistance", "It also offers its wielder protection from certain sources. For an overview of your resistances (among other things) press {resists_key}{tile_control}.", "它还能保护持有者免受某些伤害来源影响。按{resists_key}{tile_control}可查看抗性等信息。", "resists_key:key_markup;tile_control:text"},
    {"item.hints.staff.school", "This staff can enhance your spellcasting, making spells of its related spell school more powerful.", "这根法杖可以强化你的施法能力，使相关法术学派的法术更强。", ""},
    {"item.hints.staff.trog", "Seeing how {god} frowns upon the use of magic, this staff will be of little use to you and you might just as well {drop_key}rop it now.", "既然{god}不喜欢使用魔法，这根法杖对你用处不大，不如现在就按{drop_key}丢掉。", "god:name;drop_key:key_markup"},
    {"item.hints.target_mode.fire", "then be taken to target mode with the nearest monster or previous target already targeted. You can also cycle through all hostile monsters in sight with <w>+</w> or <w>-</w>. Once you're aiming at the correct monster, simply hit <w>f</w>, <w>Enter</w> or <w>.</w> to shoot at it. If you miss, {repeat_key} fires at the same target again.", "随后会进入瞄准模式，并预先瞄准最近的怪物或上一个目标。你也可以按<w>+</w>或<w>-</w>循环切换视野内的敌对怪物。瞄准正确的怪物后，按<w>f</w>、<w>Enter</w>或<w>.</w>即可射击。若未命中，按{repeat_key}可再次向同一目标射击。", "repeat_key:key_markup"},
    {"item.hints.target_mode.spell", "then be taken to target mode with the nearest monster or previous target already targeted. You can also cycle through all hostile monsters in sight with <w>+</w> or <w>-</w>. Once you're aiming at the correct monster, simply hit <w>f</w>, <w>Enter</w> or <w>.</w> to shoot at it. If you miss, {repeat_key} fires at the same target again.", "随后会进入瞄准模式，并预先瞄准最近的怪物或上一个目标。你也可以按<w>+</w>或<w>-</w>循环切换视野内的敌对怪物。瞄准正确的怪物后，按<w>f</w>、<w>Enter</w>或<w>.</w>即可施放。若未命中，按{repeat_key}可再次向同一目标施法。", "repeat_key:key_markup"},
    {"item.hints.throw.plural.no_slot", "To do this, press {fire_key} to fire, then select these {item_name}s. You'll {target_suffix}", "要这样做，按{fire_key}射击，然后选择这些{item_name}。{target_suffix}", "fire_key:key_markup;item_name:name;target_suffix:text"},
    {"item.hints.throw.plural.slot", "To do this, press {fire_key} to fire, then <w>{item_slot}</w> for these {item_name}s. You'll {target_suffix}", "要这样做，按{fire_key}射击，然后按<w>{item_slot}</w>选择这些{item_name}。{target_suffix}", "fire_key:key_markup;item_slot:key;item_name:name;target_suffix:text"},
    {"item.hints.throw.singular.no_slot", "To do this, press {fire_key} to fire, then select this {item_name}. You'll {target_suffix}", "要这样做，按{fire_key}射击，然后选择该{item_name}。{target_suffix}", "fire_key:key_markup;item_name:name;target_suffix:text"},
    {"item.hints.throw.singular.slot", "To do this, press {fire_key} to fire, then <w>{item_slot}</w> for this {item_name}. You'll {target_suffix}", "要这样做，按{fire_key}射击，然后按<w>{item_slot}</w>选择该{item_name}。{target_suffix}", "fire_key:key_markup;item_slot:key;item_name:name;target_suffix:text"},
    {"item.hints.tiles.armour_click", ", or, alternatively, simply click on their tiles to perform either action", "，或者直接点击护甲图标执行对应操作", ""},
    {"item.hints.tiles.avatar_right_click", " or click on your avatar with the <w>right mouse button</w>", "，或<w>用鼠标右键点击</w>角色头像", ""},
    {"item.hints.tiles.jewellery_click", ", though in Tiles, either can be done by clicking on the item in your inventory", "，在 Tiles 中，也可以点击物品栏里的饰品完成穿脱", ""},
    {"item.hints.tiles.potion_click", "or simply click on it with your <w>left mouse button</w>", "，或<w>用鼠标左键点击</w>药水", ""},
    {"item.hints.tiles.scroll_click", "or simply click on it with your <w>left mouse button</w>", "，或<w>用鼠标左键点击</w>卷轴", ""},
    {"item.hints.wand.tiles.fullscreen", "Alternatively, you can 1) <w>left mouse click</w> on the monster you wish to target (or your player character to target yourself) while pressing the <w>Alt key</w> and pick the wand from the menu, or 2) <w>left mouse click</w> on the wand tile and then <w>left mouse click</w> on your target.", "也可以：1）按住<w>Alt</w>并<w>用鼠标左键点击</w>目标怪物（若要以自己为目标，则点击角色），再从菜单中选择魔杖；或 2）先<w>用鼠标左键点击</w>魔杖图标，再<w>用鼠标左键点击</w>目标。", ""},
    {"item.hints.wand.tiles.web", "Alternatively, you can 1) <w>left mouse click</w> on the monster you wish to target (or your player character to target yourself) while pressing the <w>Ctrl + Shift keys</w> and pick the wand from the menu, or 2) <w>left mouse click</w> on the wand tile and then <w>left mouse click</w> on your target.", "也可以：1）按住<w>Ctrl + Shift</w>并<w>用鼠标左键点击</w>目标怪物（若要以自己为目标，则点击角色），再从菜单中选择魔杖；或 2）先<w>用鼠标左键点击</w>魔杖图标，再<w>用鼠标左键点击</w>目标。", ""},
    {"item.hints.wand.tiles.windowed", "Alternatively, you can 1) <w>left mouse click</w> on the monster you wish to target (or your player character to target yourself) while pressing the <w>Ctrl + Shift keys</w> and pick the wand from the menu, or 2) <w>left mouse click</w> on the wand tile and then <w>left mouse click</w> on your target.", "也可以：1）按住<w>Ctrl + Shift</w>并<w>用鼠标左键点击</w>目标怪物（若要以自己为目标，则点击角色），再从菜单中选择魔杖；或 2）先<w>用鼠标左键点击</w>魔杖图标，再<w>用鼠标左键点击</w>目标。", ""},
    {"item.hints.wand.use", "The magic within can be unleashed by evoking ({evoke_key}) it.", "按{evoke_key}即可发动魔杖中的魔力。", "evoke_key:key_markup"},
    {"item.hints.weapon.artefact.ability", "When wielded, some weapons (such as this one) offer certain abilities you can activate. {ability_hint}", "某些武器（例如这件）挥舞后会提供可发动的能力。{ability_hint}", "ability_hint:text"},
    {"item.hints.weapon.artefact.resistance", "This weapon offers its wearer protection from certain damage sources. For an overview of your resistances (among other things) press {resists_key}{tile_control}.", "这把武器能保护持有者免受某些伤害来源影响。按{resists_key}{tile_control}可查看抗性等信息。", "resists_key:key_markup;tile_control:text"},
    {"item.hints.weapon.melee.wielded", "To attack a monster, you can simply walk into it.", "要攻击怪物，只需走向它。", ""},
    {"item.hints.weapon.ranged.wielded", "To attack a monster, press {attack_key}. You'll {target_suffix}", "要攻击怪物，按{attack_key}。{target_suffix}", "attack_key:key_markup;target_suffix:text"},
    {"item.hints.weapon.ranged.wielded.tile", "To attack a monster, <w>left mouse click</w> on the monster.\n\nTo fire a ranged weapon using the keyboard, press {attack_key}. You'll {target_suffix}", "要攻击怪物，<w>用鼠标左键点击</w>怪物。\n\n要用键盘发射远程武器，按{attack_key}。{target_suffix}", "attack_key:key_markup;target_suffix:text"},
    {"item.hints.weapon.training_gap", "However, you've been training in <w>{best_skill}</w> for a while, so maybe you should continue training that rather than <w>{weapon_skill}</w>. (Press {skills_key} to see the skill management screen for the actual numbers.)", "不过，你已经训练<w>{best_skill}</w>一段时间了；或许应继续训练它，而不是<w>{weapon_skill}</w>。（按{skills_key}可在技能管理界面查看具体数值。）", "best_skill:name;weapon_skill:name;skills_key:key_markup"},
    {"item.hints.weapon.unwielded", "You can wield this weapon with {wield_key}, or use {swap_key} to switch between the weapons in slot a and b. (Use {adjust_key} to adjust item slots.)", "按{wield_key}可挥舞这把武器，按{swap_key}可切换 a、b 栏中的武器。（按{adjust_key}可调整物品栏位。）", "wield_key:key_markup;swap_key:key_markup;adjust_key:key_markup"},
    {"item.jewellery.reflection_effect", "\n\nIt affects your shielding ({amount}).", "\n\n它会影响你的格挡能力（{amount}）。", "amount:text"},
    {"item.jewellery.slaying_effect", "\n\nIt affects your accuracy and damage with ranged weapons and melee ({amount}).", "\n\n它会影响你使用远程武器和近战武器时的命中与伤害（{amount}）。", "amount:text"},
    {"item.jewellery.stat_effect", "\n\nIt affects your {stat} ({amount}).", "\n\n它会影响你的{stat}（{amount}）。", "stat:text;amount:text"},
    {"item.location.offlevel", "It can be found on {level}.", "可在{level}找到。", "level:key"},
    {"item.miscellany.display.charges", "{name} ({charges}/{maximum})", "{name}（{charges}/{maximum}）", "name:name;charges:integer;maximum:integer"},
    {"item.miscellany.display.evoker_plus", "+{level} {name}", "+{level}{name}", "level:integer;name:name"},
    {"item.miscellany.display.inert", "{name} (inert)", "{name}（失活）", "name:name"},
    {"item.miscellany.display.quantity", "{quantity} {name}", "{quantity}件{name}", "quantity:integer;name:name"},
    {"item.miscellany.display.ziggurat_progress", "+{count} {name}", "+{count}次{name}", "count:integer;name:name"},
