    {"monster.draconian.scales.grey", "It has grey scales.", "它长着灰色鳞片。", ""},
    {"monster.draconian.scales.pale", "It has pale scales.", "它长着苍白色鳞片。", ""},
    {"monster.draconian.scales.purple", "It has purple scales.", "它长着紫色鳞片。", ""},
    {"monster.draconian.scales.red", "It has red scales.", "它长着红色鳞片。", ""},
    {"monster.draconian.scales.white", "It has white scales.", "它长着白色鳞片。", ""},
    {"monster.draconian.scales.yellow", "It has yellow scales.", "它长着黄色鳞片。", ""},
    {"monster.habitat.lava_travel", "It can travel through lava.", "可在熔岩中穿行。", ""},
    {"monster.habitat.water_surface", "It can walk on water.", "可在水面上行走。", ""},
    {"monster.habitat.water_travel", "It can travel through water.", "可在水中穿行。", ""},
    {"monster.hit_chance", "It has about {hit_percent}% to hit you.\n", "它命中你的几率约为{hit_percent}%。\n", "hit_percent:integer"},
    {"monster.hit_chance_plural", "They have about {hit_percent}% to hit you.\n", "它们命中你的几率约为{hit_percent}%。\n", "hit_percent:integer"},
    {"monster.lore.alderking", "A self-styled monarch of a shambling black alder, half respected and half\nridiculed by other fae. It backs up its aspirations to sovereignty with\nunearthly vile magic quite close to a touch of death.", "一个自封的君主，本体是一株蹒跚而行的黑色桤木，\n在其他妖精中一半受尊敬、一半遭嘲弄。\n它用近乎死亡之触的超凡邪恶魔法，支撑起自己对王权的野心。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.armataur", "A curious quadraped, resembling a cross between an armadillo and a yaktaur.", "一种奇特的四足生物，形似犰狳与牦牛人杂交的产物。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.bes_kemwar", "A minor hairy maggot spirit, phasing in and out of this plane. Each regional\nvariant inflicts different minor ailments: the ones found in the Dungeon\ncause one's magic to grow weak.", "一种低阶的多毛蛆虫精魂，在本位面中不断相位进出。\n每个地区变体都会施加不同的小病痛：地牢中的那些\n会让你的魔力变得衰弱。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.blorkula_the_orcula", "Once a gangly and bedraggled vampire with a strange obsession with colour,\nBlorkula was offered succour by a missionary of Beogh and became a portly and\nvigorous orc with a strange obsession with colour instead.\n\nHe wields magic tinged with every hue of the rainbow, and has mastered the art\nof dividing his own form among its many colours to avoid killing blows - though\neven he must rest a while before doing so a second time.", "布洛库拉曾是个瘦骨嶙峋、满身泥污的吸血鬼，对颜色有着奇怪的痴迷，\n后来比欧弗的一位传教士向他施以援手，于是他变成了一个体态臃肿、精力充沛的兽人，\n对颜色的痴迷倒是丝毫未改。\n\n他施展的魔法染上了彩虹的每一种色调，并且精通将自身形体\n分散于诸多色彩之间以避开致命一击的技艺——不过即便是他，\n也得歇息片刻才能再次这样做。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.bomblet", "A small metal sphere surrounding a core of dormant fire magic. When given the\nproper command, it will detonate in a blast of metal and flame that is only\npartially affected by fire resistance.", "一个小金属球，包裹着一团休眠的火魔法核心。\n一旦接到正确的指令，它就会在金属与火焰的爆炸中引爆，\n这种爆炸只部分受火焰抗性影响。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.boundless_tesseract", "An impossible shape that scintillates with unearthly colour. The power of Zot\nflows heavily through it, overlaying this reality with countless others where\nits domain remains pristine.\n\nEach tesseract is inextricably linked to the other, and destroying one will\ndestroy both (and expel all the creatures they have beckoned to this reality,\nas well as dazing even those which they have not). But so long as they are\nallowed to exist, there will be no end to the forces which seek to keep you from\nthe Orb.", "一个不可能存在的形状，闪烁着超凡脱俗的色彩。佐特的力量\n在其间汹涌流淌，将无数个其领域依然纯净无瑕的现实\n叠覆于这个世界之上。\n\n每个超立方体都与另一个密不可分，摧毁其中一个就会\n使两者一同毁灭（并将它们召入这个现实的所有生物驱逐出去，\n连那些它们尚未召唤的生物也会陷入晕眩）。但只要它们\n被允许存在，阻止你夺取宝珠的力量就永无止境。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.burstshroom", "A rapidly-growing mushroom whose life-cycle culminates in an explosive release\nof spores. These spores have a mild psychoactive effect and can sometimes daze\ncreatures who breathe them in.", "一种生长迅速的蘑菇，其生命周期以爆炸性地释放孢子而告终。\n这些孢子有轻微的致幻作用，有时会让吸入它们的生物陷入晕眩。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.cassandra", "As a young woman, Cassandra bound herself in service to Ashenzari and was\nblessed and cursed in equal measure - granted the ability to foresee disasters,\nbut only those she was powerless to prevent.\n\nEventually driven from her homeland as a harbinger of the very plagues she'd\nspent a lifetime warning against, she has come to the dungeon in her final days\nin hope of averting one last catastrophe.", "卡珊德拉年轻时将自己献身于侍奉艾申扎利，所受的祝福与诅咒\n分量相当——她被赋予了预见灾难的能力，\n但能预见的只有那些她无力阻止的灾难。\n\n最终，她因成为那些她穷尽一生警告世人的瘟疫的先兆而被逐出故土，\n于是她在生命的最后时日来到地牢，\n希望能避免最后一场灾难。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.caustic_sporangium", "A balloon-like sac of slime mold spores, suspended in a nutrient slurry to\nsustain them on their search for a new home. To the great misfortune of any\nadventurers in the vicinity, this slurry is also a highly potent acid.", "一个气球状的黏菌孢子囊，悬浮在营养液中，以维持它们寻找新家的旅途。\n对附近任何冒险者来说极为不幸的是，这种营养液也是一种强效酸液。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.chonchon", "Some sorcerers care little for unholy realms or undead forms, seeking power\ninstead in the whims of cruel chaos. This ominous owl-winged head is all that\nremains of a former archmage: it delights in spreading misfortune and drinking\nblood in its new airborne form.", "有些巫师对不洁领域或亡灵形态不屑一顾，转而从残酷混沌的无常中寻求力量。\n这颗带着猫头鹰翅膀的不祥头颅就是一位前大法师仅存的一切：\n它喜欢散播厄运，并以自己这新的飞行形态吸血。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.clockroach", "A common dungeon pest that combines the worst features of a scavenging insect\nand a looming deadline.\n\nTime flows strangely around it, rewinding any injuries inflicted upon it unless\nthe source of them is near enough to be caught up in its timestream.", "一种常见的地牢害虫，兼具食腐昆虫与逼近的截止期限两者的最糟特征。\n\n时间在它周围以奇怪的方式流动，会倒回加诸于它身上的任何损伤，\n除非造成损伤的源头离得够近，被卷进它的时间之流中。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.clockwork_bee", "A mechanical insect powered by an intricate array of gears and springs. It is\nvicious and resilient to damage, but its clockwork naturally winds down as it\nattacks, eventually leaving it unable to move until its creator winds it again.", "一只由精巧的齿轮与发条阵列驱动的机械昆虫。它凶恶且难以损伤，\n但它的发条装置会随着攻击自然地松劲，\n最终令它无法移动，直到其创造者再次为它上弦。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.cognitogaunt", "A wizened, headless corpse, animated not by conventional necromancy but by the\nmournful malice of dead stars. Its psychic eyes, floating disjointedly from its\nbody's movements, relentlessly burrow through its victims' minds.", "一具干瘪的无头尸体，驱动它的并非传统的死灵术，\n而是死亡星辰那悲哀的恶意。它那与躯体动作脱节漂浮的灵能之眼，\n无情地钻探着受害者的心智。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.colossal_amoeba", "An unfathomably massive pile of mystic pulsating protoplasm. The slightest\nthreat will cause it to undergo rapid weaponised mitosis, rapidly overwhelming\npotential meals in a cytoplasmic tidal wave.", "一团大得不可思议、神秘搏动着的原生质。哪怕是最轻微的威胁，\n也会使它迅速进行武器化的有丝分裂，\n以细胞质构成的潮水迅速吞没潜在的餐食。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.crawling_flesh_cage", "A modern breakthrough in arcane experimentation, this mobile prison cell\nweaponises the living fragments of once-escaped ugly things, extending the reach\nof their tendrils to thrash multiple foes at once from a distance.", "一项奥术实验的现代突破，这个可移动的牢房将曾经逃逸的丑陋之物的活体碎片武器化，\n延展它们触须的触及范围，从远处同时抽打多个敌人。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.creeping_plasmodium", "An enormous and unnervingly motile slime mold colony. It creeps along the\ncrevices of the walls in search of nutrients and can spread itself to new\nlocations by launching enormous sporangia.", "一个巨大且动得令人不安的黏菌群落。它沿着墙壁的缝隙爬行以寻找养分，\n并能通过发射巨大的孢子囊将自身扩散到新的地方。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.diamond_sawblade", "A serrated disc forged of razor-sharp material. It spins in place at high\nvelocity, shredding through flesh and metal alike.", "一个由锋利无比的材料锻成的锯齿圆盘。它以高速原地旋转，\n能将血肉与金属一同撕裂。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.dormant_clockwork_bee", "A mechanical insect powered by an intricate array of gears and springs. It has\nrun out of power and can only be rewound by its creator moving into it.", "一只由精巧的齿轮与发条阵列驱动的机械昆虫。它已经耗尽了动力，\n只有其创造者移动靠近它才能为其再次上弦。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.draugr", "A territorial gnarl of driftwood and shattered bones. Its resentment of the\nliving has slowly twisted its remains into a monstrous form, capable of\nbrandishing weapons and spreading terrible curses.", "一团由浮木和碎骨缠结而成、极具领地意识的东西。\n它对生者的怨恨渐渐把它的遗骸扭曲成了怪物的形态，\n使它能够挥舞武器并散播可怕的诅咒。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.drude", "A conniving demon born from the nightmares of sleeping mages. It delights in\ncoaxing the imagined fears of mortals into reality.", "一个由沉睡法师的梦魇中诞生的狡诈恶魔。\n它喜欢诱使凡人想象中的恐惧化为现实。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.erythrospite", "A churning mass of flowing blood that throbs to the beat of an absent heart.\n\nDoes it wish to bury itself in your arteries because it recognises, on some\nprimordial level, that this is where it belongs\? Alas, all it is capable of in\nthis fleeing moment of sentience is violence.", "一团翻腾涌动的鲜血，随着一颗并不存在的心脏的搏动而悸动。\n\n它想要钻进你的动脉之中，是因为它在某种原始层面上认出\n那才是它的归宿吗？唉，在它这转瞬即逝的意识中，\n它所能做的唯有暴力。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.eye_of_draining", "A hovering horror, rare and unnatural even amongst servitor eyes, radiating\nbaleful energies. They monitor the flow of chaotic life and ever-present death\nfor the divine Jiyva.", "一个悬浮着的恐怖之物，即使在侍从之眼中也属罕见而反常，\n散发着邪恶的能量。它们为神圣的吉瓦监视着混沌生命\n与无处不在的死亡的流转。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.fravashi", "A beneficent remnant of the countless mortal knights who serve the Shining One.\nTheir hosts' role in the divine hierarchy is to guide and direct their legions\nin righteous moral warfare, though they may also call upon those mortals to\ndefend themselves.", "无数侍奉光明神的凡人骑士所留下的仁慈残响。\n在神圣的等级体系中，其依附者的职责是在正义的道德之战中引导并指挥麾下军团，\n不过它们也可以呼唤那些凡人来保护自身。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.globe_of_annihilation", "A roiling sphere of intense destructive energies, drawn from the fabric of the\nHells themselves. It pursues a designated target inexorably, growing in size as\nit travels. If it collides with either a creature or wall, it will explode\nviolently - though its creator is protected from the wild destruction unleashed\nas it does so.", "一团由取自地狱本身构造的强烈毁灭能量翻腾而成的球体。它会毫不留情地追猎指定目标，\n并在行进途中不断增大。如果它与生物或墙壁相撞，就会猛烈爆炸——\n不过它的创造者会受到保护，免受随之释放的狂野破坏。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.goblin_rider", "Goblin clans fractured over the advent of steel exoskeletons long ago, prompting\nan experimental arms race for goblin hegemony. Some volunteered to join forces\nwith other species, an alliance that has enabled capturing and taming wyverns.\nFrom uptop their majestic dragon-like mounts, these goblins swiftly soar about\nand skewer those who intrude upon their allies' domain.", "很久以前，地精部族因钢制外骨骼的出现而分裂，掀起了争夺地精霸权的实验性军备竞赛。\n有些地精自愿与其他种族联手，这一联盟使他们得以捕获并驯服双足飞龙。\n这些地精骑在它们威严的类龙坐骑上，迅速翱翔往来，\n刺穿任何侵入盟友领地的人。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.goblin_sharper", "A goblin newly converted to Nemelex Xobeh. It's still learning about all the\ncards and, thankfully, isn't inclined to use them against you.", "一个刚皈依尼姆雷斯・索布的地精。它还在学习所有牌组的用法，\n谢天谢地，它并不打算用它们来对付你。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.grandmaster_elementalist", "<master elementalist>", "<master elementalist>", ""},
    {"monster.lore.guardian_sphinx", "A fearsome aged hybrid with a woman's head, a lion's body, and the wings of\nan eagle. It solemnly guards the temples and treasures of the Dungeon with a\nmultitude of mind-clouding maledictions.", "一个可怕而年迈的混种，长有女人头、狮身和鹰翼。\n它以众多令人神智迷乱的诅咒，\n庄重地守卫着地牢的神殿与宝藏。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.haunted_armour", "An ordinary piece of armour, held in your haunting grip. It can attack nearby\nenemies, but must return to your side if you ever stray too far from it.", "一件普通的防具，被你的鬼魅之力所握持。它能攻击附近的敌人，\n但如果你与它相距过远，它就必须回到你的身边。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.hellfire_mortar", "A terrifying weapon hewn from molten rock. It rains fiery destruction down upon\nits creators' enemies.", "一件由熔岩凿出的恐怖武器。它向创造者的敌人降下火焰的毁灭。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.hoarfrost_cannon", "An elegant siege weapon, magically sculpted from crystalline ice. As ephemeral\nas a summer snowstorm, every salvo it fires consumes a portion of itself until\nnothing is left behind but water.", "一件优雅的攻城武器，由水晶般的冰以魔法雕琢而成。\n它如夏日暴雪般转瞬即逝，\n每进行一次齐射，都会消耗自身的一部分，直到最后只留下一滩水。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.ironbound_beastmaster", "A cruel and unruly brute who growls in the language of the untamed. Its very\npresence provokes and overworks non-sapient, living beasts and slimes alike into\na rapid fervour.", "一个残忍而桀骜的蛮汉，用野性的语言咆哮。\n它只要在场，就会激起并过度驱使无智慧的活体野兽和黏液生物，\n让它们迅速陷入狂热。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.ironbound_mechanist", "A well-armoured coglin whose talents with machinery have been harnessed by the\nIronbound order to repair and augment the many constructs that help guard the\nVaults.", "一个全副武装的齿轮地精，其机械才能被铁缚会所用，\n负责修理和强化众多协助守卫宝库的构装体。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.kobold_fleshcrafter", "A skull-masked kobold, its body mutated by forbidden magics. It conducts vile\nexperiments in the service of demonic powers, formulating ever more terrible\nmonstrosities as vessels for devilish minds.", "一个戴着骷髅面具的狗头人，身体被禁忌的魔法所变异。\n它效力于恶魔势力，进行邪恶的实验，\n不断制造出愈发可怕的怪物，作为恶魔心智的容器。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.kobold_geomancer", "A wily kobold who has learned to weaponise every crack and crevice that lines\nthe walls of its domain.", "一个狡黠的狗头人，学会了将自己领地墙壁上的\n每一道裂缝和罅隙都化为武器。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.marrowcuda", "The flame-wreathed skeleton of a carnivorous fish, darting through air as easily\nas it once parted water. It burns with a hunger it could not satisfy in life and\nis singularly driven by in death.\n\nWhile a single one may be only a nuisance, the swarm is never far behind, and\nevery bite it lands will summon more and more of them until every scrap of flesh\non its prey has been devoured.", "一具缠绕着火焰的食肉鱼骨架，在空气中穿梭，一如它生前破开水面那般轻易。\n它燃烧着生前无法满足的饥饿，\n死后更是被这份饥饿唯一地驱使着。\n\n单独一只或许只是个小麻烦，但鱼群永远紧随其后，\n它每咬中一次，就会召来越来越多的同类，\n直到猎物的每一丝血肉都被啃食殆尽。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.monarch_bomb", "A flying munitions factory, held aloft on jets of fiery exhaust and packed to\nthe brim with explosives. It can rapidly fill an area with bomblets, and when\ncommanded by its creator, will explode them all (and itself) to devastating\neffect.", "一座飞行的弹药工厂，靠炽热的喷气流悬停于空中，里面塞满了炸药。\n它能迅速用小型炸弹填满一片区域，而当其创造者下令时，\n它会将它们（以及它自己）全部引爆，造成毁灭性的效果。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.morphogenic_ooze", "A multihued mire of roiling flesh and fluctuating sludge, striving and failing\nfor more coherence than any other slime. As a fresh carrier of the ruinous\ncontagion that overtook the Slime Pits, it can impart unto others the same\nhorrible fate. While it may not be a permanent transformation for you, the\nmelding of weapons and armour, as well as the severe weakening of spells, may\nmake it a lethal one regardless.", "一团色彩斑斓的泥沼，由翻腾的血肉与起伏不定的淤泥构成，\n比任何其他黏液都更努力地追求形态的统一，却总是失败。\n作为席卷了黏液坑洞的毁灭性传染的新近携带者，\n它能将同样可怕的命运施加于他人。\n对你而言，这种转变或许并非永久性的，但武器与防具的熔合，\n以及法术的严重削弱，仍可能让它变成致命的转变。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.mountainshell", "An enormous land tortoise whose shell is so thick and rock-encrusted that\nsleeping ones are frequently mistaken for geological formations. And like a\nmountain, its exterior is nearly impervious to any destructive force; only at\nclose range can one properly aim for the narrow gaps between its plates to\nstrike the tender flesh within.", "一只巨大的陆龟，它的壳厚实且布满岩石，\n以至于睡着时常被误认为地质构造。就像一座山一样，\n它的外壳几乎不受任何破坏性力量的影响；\n只有在近距离，才能准确瞄准它甲板之间狭窄的缝隙，\n击中其中柔嫩的肉。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.nascent_plasmodium", "A slime mold colony in an early phase of its life cycle. Not yet mature enough\nto reproduce, it can still defend itself by firing globs of potent acid.", "一个处于生命周期早期的黏菌群落。它尚未成熟到能够繁殖，\n但仍能通过发射强效酸液团来保护自己。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.nekomata", "An upright feliform trickster of an elderly demon, with a forked tail ablaze\nwith a shimmering haze. It holds a deep disdain for mortal humanoids, a\npatronising pity for mortal cats, and enough mystic might to subjugate both.", "一个直立行走、形似猫科动物的年迈恶魔，也是个狡诈之徒，\n分叉的尾巴上燃烧着闪烁的烟气。\n它对凡人的人形生物深怀蔑视，对凡间的猫则抱着居高临下的怜悯，\n而它的神秘力量足以将二者都收服。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.nobody", "A time-lost revenant, risen not from the death of a single individual but of\nmany - its bones fused together from the young and the elderly and different\nspecies altogether. Whether they were all the victims of a single massacre or\na thousand souls discarded over a thousand years is impossible to say now;\nhistory does not remember them.\n\nBut one thing is clear: they will fight to change that until every last memory\nthey have left burns away.", "一个迷失于时光中的亡魂，它的苏醒并非源于某个人的死亡，\n而是源于许多人的死亡——它的骨骸由年轻人、老人乃至\n不同种族的骨头熔合而成。他们究竟是一场屠杀的全部受害者，\n还是一千年间被抛弃的一千个灵魂，如今已无从知晓；\n历史不曾记住他们。\n\n但有一件事是明确的：他们会一直战斗以改变这一切，直到\n他们残存的最后一丝记忆也燃烧殆尽。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.obsidian_bat", "A faceless stone bat unearthed from infernal chasms. Devilish beasts hunt in its\nwake.", "一只从地狱深渊中出土的无脸石蝙蝠。恶魔般的野兽在它身后尾随狩猎。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.oni_incarcerator", "An infamous, dutiful retainer of Gehenna. These immense and indomitable oni\nweave their weapons through reality itself to reach and capture the innumerable\ndamned souls owed to the hells upon their deaths.", "欣嫩谷一个臭名昭著而又尽职尽责的侍从。\n这些庞大而不屈的鬼把武器穿透现实本身，\n以触及并捕获无数死后归于地狱的受诅咒之魂。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.orb_of_entropy", "A globe of profound nothingness and the oblivion that awaits all things - flesh,\nsouls, and even time itself. When the universe ends, only these will remain.", "一个球体，蕴含着深奥的虚无，以及等待着万物的湮灭——\n血肉、灵魂，乃至时间本身。当宇宙终结之时，唯有它们会留存下来。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.orb_of_winter", "A globe of deepest cold, still lingering from a time before the stars lit the\nheavens. It can shroud the soul in a chill so intense that even the gods cannot\nreach it.", "一个至寒的球体，从群星点亮苍穹之前的时代一直留存至今。\n它能让灵魂裹上一层酷寒，强烈到连众神也无法触及。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.orc_apostle", "An orcish wayfarer who has been touched by the hand of Beogh. Whether out of\nreligious devotion or personal jealousy, they have come to bar your path.\n\nHold nothing back - for neither they nor their followers will do so.\n\nGlory to Beogh!", "一名被比欧弗之手触碰过的兽人旅者。无论出于宗教的虔诚，还是出于个人的嫉妒，\n他们都来此阻挡你的去路。\n\n不要留手——因为他们和他们的追随者都不会留手。\n\n荣耀归于比欧弗！", ""},
    {"monster.lore.orc_apostle_follower", "A favoured child of Beogh, once not so unlike yourself.\n\nNow that you have proven yourself to them, they will fight and die for both you\nand the cause. Shepherd them well.", "比欧弗宠爱的孩子，曾经与你并没有多大不同。\n\n既然你已经向他们证明了自己，他们就会为你和这事业而战、而死。\n好好带领他们吧。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.petrified_flower", "A sizeable and statuesque flower, fossilised either by bitter grief or the cruel\ngrace of divinity, standing in its own eternal vigil.", "一朵硕大而宛如雕像的花，或因苦涩的悲伤、或因神明残酷的恩典化为化石，\n独自站立着永恒的守夜。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.phalanx_beetle", "An intricate mechanical beetle covered in reinforced metal plates that resemble\na shield. It projects a kinetic barrier around its creator while adjacent to\nthem, increasing their armour class.\n\nIt will never voluntarily leave its creator's side, and if forcibly seperated,\nwill prioritise returning to them over any other concerns.", "一只精巧复杂的机械甲虫，覆着形似盾牌的强化金属板。\n当它与其创造者相邻时，会在创造者周围投射出一道动能屏障，\n提高其护甲等级。\n\n它绝不会主动离开创造者身边；如果被强行分开，\n它会优先回到其身边，将其他一切顾虑置于其后。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.pile_of_debris", "A heavily ruptured stonework, surrounded by rubble.", "一处严重破裂的石造物，周围散落着瓦砾。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.pile_of_flesh", "A leftover mess of broken bones, inert grasping organs, and scattered skin.\nWhile some highly-specialised sorcerers might be capable of bringing it to life,\nit is otherwise harmless - the possible leftovers of some departed or\nabsent-minded magus.", "一堆残留的杂物：破碎的骨头、失去活力的抓握器官和散落的皮肤。\n虽然某些高度专精的巫师或许有能力赋予它生命，\n但它本身是无害的——可能是某个离去或心不在焉的魔法师留下的残渣。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.pillar_of_rime", "A spire of strangely tenebrous ice, its brittle tendrils reaching skyward like\nthe fingers of an outstretched hand. {{\n    if spells.memorised(\"rimeblight\") then\n        return \"If only the dying breath of every soul could create such art.\"\n    else\n        return \"It might even be beautiful if you didn't know the gruesome \" ..\n               \"way it formed.\"\n    end\n}}", "一座奇异地幽暗的冰之尖塔，它易碎的触须朝天空伸展，宛如一只张开的巨手的手指。 {{\n    if spells.memorised(\"rimeblight\") then return \"要是每一个灵魂的临终之息都能创造出这样的艺术就好了。\"\n    else\n        return \"如果不知道它形成的方式有多么可怖，\" ..\n               \"它甚至可以说是美丽的。\"\n    end\n}}", ""},
    {"monster.lore.platinum_paragon", "A gleaming warrior, wrought from precious metals and the very pinnacle of\nforgecraft techniques. Its every motion flows with a deadly, fluid grace that\nbelies its artifical nature.", "一名闪闪发光的战士，由贵金属铸成，代表着锻冶工艺的巅峰。\n它的一举一动都流淌着致命而流畅的优雅，\n与它的造物本质截然不符。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.poltergeist", "A ghostly trickster that is fond of possessing small objects and making them\nfly noisily through the air.", "一个幽灵般的捣蛋鬼，喜欢附身于小物件，\n让它们吵闹地飞过空中。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.polterguardian", "Many poltergeists are fiercely territorial over the domains they choose to\nhaunt, but these have extended that protection even to the people who share\ntheir domain with them. Some say they must be the lingering souls of those who\nguarded the Vaults in life; others suggest the Ironbound Order simply recruited\nthem in common cause. Whichever is true, their very presence shelters other\ncreatures from missiles, causing sling and spell alike to veer off-course at the\nlast moment.", "许多骚灵对它们选择作祟的领地有着极强的领地意识，\n而它们把这种保护延伸到了与它们共享领地的人身上。\n有人说，它们必定是那些生前守卫宝库之人的残留灵魂；\n也有人认为，是铁缚会出于共同的目标招募了它们。\n无论真相如何，它们的存在本身就能让其他生物免受飞射物的袭击，\n使投石索与法术在最后一刻偏离轨迹。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.raven", "A jet-black corvid with a nasty beak and a reputation for heralding bad luck.\nMost ornithologists consider this a baseless stereotype; the rest are still\nrecovering from a series of staggeringly unlikely accidents.", "一只漆黑的渡鸦，长着凶狠的喙，因预示厄运而声名在外。\n大多数鸟类学家认为这不过是毫无根据的刻板印象；\n其余的人则仍在从一连串难以置信的离奇事故中恢复过来。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.rending_blade", "A crackling weapon formed of condensed magical energy. It can cut through entire\nrows of adversaries whenever its creator lands a melee attack.", "一件由凝聚的魔法能量形成、噼啪作响的武器。每当它的创造者近战命中时，\n它就能斩穿整整一排敌人。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.revenant_soulmonger", "A timeworn revenant whose flames dance with the silhouettes of long-forgotten\natrocities. Cursed with a hunger they can never satisfy, they unleash these\nlong-dead echoes to reenact violence upon any soul they deem worthy of adding to\ntheir eternal collection.", "一个饱经岁月的亡魂，它的火焰中舞动着早已被遗忘的暴行的剪影。\n它被永远无法满足的饥饿所诅咒，\n于是释放这些死去已久的回响，对任何被它认为值得收入永恒收藏的灵魂重演暴行。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.rock_fish", "A strange stone-scaled fish that swims through solid rock with the same ease\nthat most fish do through water.", "一条奇特的石鳞鱼，它在坚硬的岩石中游动，\n就像大多数鱼在水中一样轻松自如。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.sacred_lotus", "A large and vivid bloom drifting placidly upon the surface of the water. The\ncradle of the lotus's petals shine with eternity and elegance - while it is\nentirely harmless, it would take immense effort to destroy it.", "一朵硕大而鲜艳的花，静静地漂在水面上。\n莲花花瓣的摇篮闪耀着永恒与优雅——\n它完全无害，但要摧毁它却需要付出极大的努力。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.screaming_refraction", "A deeply unfortunate soul mostly processed into crystal by some malevolent tear\nin reality. Ethereal reflections of its past and future suffering are cast upon\nnearby surfaces and foes.", "一个极为不幸的灵魂，大部分已被现实中某道恶意的裂口转化为水晶。\n它过去与未来所受苦难的空灵倒影，\n会投射在附近的表面和敌人身上。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.scrub_nettle", "An irritable, bristling shrub. It fends off anything that might graze upon it by\nlaunching some of its innumerable toxic stinging hairs.", "一株暴躁而毛刺丛生的灌木。它会发射自己无数有毒的蜇毛，\n以此击退任何可能啃食它的东西。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.seismosaurus", "A stubborn and fiercely territorial lizard with the strength of a mountain. Its\nthunderous footfalls herald violent tremors.", "一只固执且领地意识极强的蜥蜴，有着山岳般的力量。\n它雷鸣般的脚步会引发剧烈的震动。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.seismosaurus_egg", "A lizard egg the size of a small boulder and nearly as hard. Perhaps as a\ndefence mechanism, they hatch rapidly in the presence of predators and even a\nnewborn can give all but the most ambitious of monsters a reason to consider an\neasier meal.", "一枚蜥蜴蛋，有小巨砾那么大，也几乎一样坚硬。\n也许是作为一种防御机制，它们在捕食者面前会迅速孵化，\n而即便是刚出生的幼崽，也能让除最有野心的怪物之外的所有怪物\n考虑换一顿更容易的饭。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.shadow", "A featureless silhouette of your own body, moving independently through the\ndivine power of Dithmenos. No matter how many times it is struck down, it will\nreform itself, for a shadow is inextinguishable so long as whatever cast it\nremains.", "一个与你自身躯体一模一样的、毫无特征的剪影，凭迪斯姆诺的神力独立行动。\n无论被击倒多少次，它都会重新成形，\n因为只要投射它的存在尚在，暗影便无法被消灭。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.shadow_prism", "A prism-like silhouette which wavers with barely-contained destructive energy.\nAny blow which disrupts its form will result in a violent blast of shadow.", "一个棱镜状的剪影，随着几乎无法抑制的破坏性能量摇曳不定。\n任何能扰乱其形态的打击都会引发一场猛烈的暗影爆炸。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.shadow_puppet", "A minor servant of living shadow whose form wavers perpetually on the edge of\nrecognition - as if an unseen light were flickering behind something almost\nfamiliar.\n\nThe strength of its attacks increases in proportion with the power of the spell\nwhich summoned it.", "一个活体暗影的低阶仆从，其形态始终徘徊在似曾相识的边缘——\n仿佛有一道看不见的光在某种几乎熟悉之物背后闪烁。\n\n它攻击的威力与召唤它的法术的强度成正比。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.shadow_turret", "A strangely static silhouette whose form suggests a large cannon. Though it uses\nno gunpowder, the depths of its bore flickers angrily with every shot, as if\nremembering the fiery light of its ignition.", "一个奇怪地静止不动的剪影，形态让人联想到一门口径巨大的火炮。\n它虽不使用火药，但炮膛深处每开一炮都会愤怒地闪烁，\n仿佛在回忆着它点火时那炽热的光芒。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.shooting_star", "A glimmering spark of magical energy. It seeks out nearby enemies to expend\nitself upon, dealing damage and pushing them backwards.\n\nIt does not block its allies' line of fire.", "一点闪烁的魔法能量火花。它会找出附近的敌人，将自身消耗在它们身上，\n造成伤害并将它们向后推开。\n\n它不会阻挡友方的射击路线。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.slymdra", "A quivering amalgam of viscous slime, its many pseudopods gnashing at the air\nlike a throng of reptilian maws. It rapidly absorbs nearby slime creatures into\nitself, growing a new 'head' for each one and becoming even more resilient.\n\nWhether through convergent evolution or genetic memory, it also shares the\nhydra's most infamous trait: lopping off a head with a bladed weapon will just\nmake it grow two more unless the wound is cauterised by a flaming weapon.\n\nWhen not stalking prey, its constituent slimes may separate from it again,\nperhaps to seek new food sources on their own.", "一团颤抖的黏稠黏液集合体，它众多的伪足在空中撕咬，如同一群爬行动物的巨口。\n它会迅速把附近的黏液生物吸收进自身，每吸收一只就长出一个新的“头”，\n也变得更加坚韧。\n\n无论是出于趋同进化还是基因记忆，它同样拥有九头蛇最臭名昭著的特征：\n用有刃武器砍掉一个头只会让它再长出两个，\n除非用带火焰的武器灼烧伤口。\n\n在不追猎猎物的时候，构成它的黏液可能会再次分离出去，\n或许是为了自行寻找新的食物来源。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.solar_ember", "A mote of intense light and heat manifested by a sun scarab. It is linked to\ntheir essence and will never leave their side, being reconstituted time and time\nagain whenever it is extinguished.\n\nSome myths even claim that the sun which shines down upon the outside world was\nonce carried around by such a scarab.", "一点由太阳圣甲虫显现出来的强烈光热的微尘。它与圣甲虫的本质相连，\n永远不会离开它们的身边，\n每当它熄灭时，都会被一次又一次地重新构成。\n\n有些神话甚至宣称，照耀着地表的太阳，\n曾经就被这样一只圣甲虫携带着四处巡游。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.soul_wisp", "A tiny fragment of a living soul, splintered from the body in which it belongs.\nToo mindless to be fully controlled, it seeks nothing but to reunite with its\ngreater self once more - unfortunately, this process tends to be more violent\nthan the magic which created it.", "一个活体灵魂的微小碎片，从它所归属的躯体上崩裂下来。\n它过于缺乏心智，无法被完全控制，\n除了再次与其更大的本体重聚之外别无所求——\n可惜的是，这一过程往往比创造它的魔法更加猛烈。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.sphinx_marauder", "A wicked youthful hybrid with a woman's head, a lion's body, and the wings of\nan eagle. It gleefully wreaks havoc with both the violent turbulence of\nhigh winds and the frustration of bewildering magics.", "一个邪恶而年轻的混种，长有女人头、狮身和鹰翼。\n它会兴高采烈地用狂风的猛烈气流，\n以及令人困惑的魔法带来的挫败感，大肆制造破坏。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.splinterfrost_barricade", "A durable barricade made of ice reinforced with forgecraft magic. A lattice of\nprecise hairline cracks are visible just beneath its surface which allow it to\nfracture into a barrage of razor-sharp projectiles whenever it sustains critical\ndamage.", "一道坚固的路障，由经锻冶魔法强化的冰制成。\n它的表面之下可以看到由精细的发丝状裂纹组成的网格，\n这使得它在受到严重损伤时能够碎裂成一连串锋利无比的高速碎片。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.spriggan_baker", "A spriggan that has mastered the culinary arts.", "一个精通烹饪艺术的树精。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.sprozz", "A former beekeeper's apprentice with an ambitious dream: to modernise the whole\nworld's beekeeping industry with the smooth certainty of disease-proof metal.\nHis methods may be questionable and his goals dubious, but his prototype's\nstinger still looks awfully sharp...", "一名前养蜂学徒，怀着一个野心勃勃的梦想：用不会染病的金属的平稳可靠性，\n让全世界的养蜂业都实现现代化。\n他的方法或许成问题，他的目标或许可疑，\n但他那原型机的毒刺看起来还是锋利得可怕……", ""},
    {"monster.lore.star_jelly", "A white gelatinous mound that pulses with a strange iridescence. Its body\nabsorbs magical energy like a sponge, and when sufficiently injured, will\nunleash this energy as a flurry of shooting stars.", "一团白色的凝胶状隆起物，脉动着奇异的光泽。\n它的身体像海绵一样吸收魔法能量，\n而当它受到足够重的伤害时，就会将这些能量化作一阵流星释放出来。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.thermic_dynamo", "A clashing tempest of boundless energy, channelling into capacitor jewels. Its\nwhirls of fire and ice occasionally escape and ricochet wildly off of walls.", "一场无拘无束的能量相互冲撞的风暴，汇聚进电容器宝石之中。\n它那火与冰的旋流偶尔会逸出，在墙壁间疯狂地弹射。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.training_dummy", "A mannequin used for battle practice.", "一个用于战斗训练的人偶。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.undertaker", "The Dungeon's vast repositories of the dead and the unholy realms thereafter\nboth require regular restocking and reorganisation, far beyond the coordination\nof the restless dead. These corpse-collecting constructs burrow through the\nearth and command divisions of zombified hands to assist them in stealing away\ncarrion, and may also violently create new corpses for such purposes.", "地牢中庞大的亡者储藏库，以及其后的不洁领域，\n都需要定期补充和重新整顿，这远不是那些不得安息的死者所能协调的。\n这些收集尸体的构装体穿行于地下，\n指挥着成队的僵尸之手帮它们窃取腐尸，\n也可能为此暴力地制造新的尸体。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.undying_armoury", "A swirling tempest of souls and steel: knights and blacksmiths and\nweaponmasters, all bound to weapons they once held in life. To fight one is like\nfighting an entire army.", "一场灵魂与钢铁交织的旋风暴：骑士、铁匠与武器大师，\n全都与其生前所持的武器束缚在一起。\n与其中一个作战，就像与一整支军队作战。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.vampire_bloodprince", "A scornful scion to whom even other vampires bend the knee. Their command over\nblood magic allows them to feed upon the lifeforce of entire armies at once.", "一个傲慢的贵族后裔，连其他吸血鬼也要向他屈膝。\n他对血魔法的掌控使他能一次性汲取整支军队的生命力。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.walking_alembic", "A mobile and combat-capable alchemical manufactory that uses the friction of\nmelee combat to brew a variety of useful potions. When it has built up enough\nheat to complete its synthesis, it will automatically dispense the finished\npotions to nearby allies and fall apart.", "一座可移动、能作战的炼金工坊，利用近战搏斗的摩擦来酿造各种有用的药水。\n当它积聚了足够的热量来完成合成时，\n就会自动把酿好的药水分发给附近的盟友，然后散架。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.wiglaf", "A cantankerous dwarf wearing a stupid-looking hat. He eyes you sourly, as if\ndeciding exactly how much offence he should take to the way you're staring at\nit.", "一个脾气暴躁的矮人，戴着一顶样子愚蠢的帽子。他酸溜溜地打量着你，\n仿佛正在琢磨该对你盯着那顶帽子的方式\n冒犯到什么程度。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.wyrmhole", "A small and strangely serpentine fold in space and time. Scholars once\ntheorised the Dungeon's easy access to manifold unholy realms is due to the\ntunneling of yet-undiscovered translocations dragons. Whether or not this is\ntrue, distant stars mottle this drake's endless lengths, and dimensions bend to\nits writhing whim.", "时空中的一个细小而奇异地蜿蜒的褶皱。\n学者们曾推测，地牢之所以能轻易通往诸多不洁领域，\n是由于尚未被发现的传送之龙在其中挖掘隧道。\n无论这说法是否属实，遥远的星辰在这条亚龙无尽的躯体上斑驳闪现，\n而次元则随它扭动的意志而弯曲。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.xak_krixis", "It has been centuries since outsiders were last allowed access to the cavernous\nlibraries of the formicids, but their emissaries are still seen from time to\ntime - surveying other lands for resources or scientific discoveries that might\naid the colony.\n\nThis one's study of the magical fibres excreted by orb spiders has already led\nto an alchemical breakthrough, allowing them to shape fulminant prisms such that\ntheir explosions are directed at enemies alone. Alas, their enthusiasm to\nconduct a field test bodes poorly for your health.", "自上一次允许外人进入蚁人那洞穴般的图书馆以来，\n已经过去了数个世纪，但他们的使者仍不时出现——\n为殖民地考察其他土地上的资源，\n或寻找可能有助于殖民地的科学发现。\n\n这位使者对圆蛛分泌的魔法纤维的研究，已经带来了\n一项炼金术上的突破，使他们能够把爆裂棱镜塑造成\n只将爆炸导向敌人的形态。唉，他们急于进行实地测试的热情，\n对你的健康可不是什么好兆头。", ""},
    {"monster.lore.zykzyl", "A demon born of mortal envy, its flesh undulating with a sickening wetness\nwhenever it moves. It is driven by a singular desire to reduce all beauty to a\nform as hideous as its own.", "一个由凡人的嫉妒中诞生的恶魔，每当它移动时，\n它的肉体便带着令人作呕的湿意起伏蠕动。\n它被一个唯一的欲望所驱使：把一切美都变成与它自身一样丑陋的形态。", ""},
    {"monster.mutant.facet.0", " seems unusually buggy.", "看起来异常古怪", ""},
    {"monster.mutant.facet.1", " sports a set of venomous tails", "长有一簇毒尾", ""},
    {"monster.mutant.facet.2", " flies swiftly and unpredictably", "飞行迅捷且难以预测", ""},
    {"monster.mutant.facet.3", "s breath smoulders ominously", "呼吸间隐隐冒出不祥烟气", ""},
    {"monster.mutant.facet.4", " is covered with eyes and tentacles", "遍布眼睛和触须", ""},
    {"monster.mutant.facet.5", " flickers and crackles with electricity", "周身闪烁并迸出电弧", ""},
    {"monster.mutant.facet.6", " is covered in dense fur and muscle", "覆盖着浓密皮毛且肌肉发达", ""},
    {"monster.mutant.tier.0", "It is of an unusually buggy age.", "它的年龄显得异常古怪。", ""},
    {"monster.mutant.tier.1", "It is larval and weak, freshly emerged from its mother's pouch.", "它仍处于幼体阶段，刚从母体育儿囊中出来，十分弱小。", ""},
    {"monster.mutant.tier.2", "It is a juvenile, no longer larval but below its mature strength.", "它正值幼年，已脱离幼体阶段，但尚未达到成熟时的力量。", ""},
    {"monster.mutant.tier.3", "It is mature, stronger than a juvenile but weaker than its elders.", "它已成年，比幼年个体更强，但不及年长者。", ""},
    {"monster.mutant.tier.4", "It is an elder, stronger than mature beasts.", "它已步入老年，比成年个体更强。", ""},
    {"monster.mutant.tier.5", "It is a primal beast, the most powerful of its kind.", "它已成为原始巨兽，是同类中最强大的个体。", ""},
    {"monster.notice_chance", "It has a {chance}% chance to notice you each turn.\n", "它每回合有{chance}%的几率察觉到你。\n", "chance:integer"},
    {"monster.notice_chance_plural", "They have a {chance}% chance to notice you each turn.\n", "它们每回合有{chance}%的几率察觉到你。\n", "chance:integer"},
    {"monster.quote.training_dummy", "“Things are only mannequins and even the great world-historical events are only\n costumes beneath which they exchange glances with nothingness, with the base\n and the banal.”\n    -Walter Benjamin, _Protocols to the Experiments on Hashish, Opium and\n     Mescaline 1927-1934_, “Protocol II: Highlights of the Second Hashish\n     Impression”. 15 January 1928.\n     trans. Scott J. Thompson, 1997.", "“事物不过是人体模型，甚至那些伟大的世界历史事件也不过是\n 戏服，其下它们与虚无、与卑下\n 和平庸交换着眼色。”\n    -瓦尔特·本雅明，《1927-1934年哈希什、鸦片与\n     麦司卡林实验记录》，“第二号记录：第二次哈希什\n     印象要点”。1928年1月15日。\n     译：Scott J. Thompson，1997年。", ""},
    {"monster.spell.help", "To read a description, press the key listed above. (AdB) indicates damage (the sum of A B-sided dice), (x%) indicates the chance to defeat your Will, and (y) indicates the spell range", "查看法术说明请按上方列出的按键。(AdB)表示伤害（A颗B面骰子的总和），(x%)表示克服你意志力的概率，(y)表示法术射程", ""},
    {"monster.spell.range_period", ".", "。", ""},
    {"monster.spell.range_warning", "; shown in red if you are in range.", "；若你处于施法范围内，该法术会以红色显示。", ""},
    {"monster.status_reference.1", "[[asleep monstatus]]", "[[asleep monstatus]]", ""},
    {"monster.status_reference.2", "[[catching its breath monstatus]]", "[[catching its breath monstatus]]", ""},
    {"monster.status_reference.3", "[[contaminated monstatus]]", "[[contaminated monstatus]]", ""},
    {"monster.status_reference.4", "[[high-tier stab monstatus]]", "[[high-tier stab monstatus]]", ""},
    {"monster.status_reference.5", "[[low-tier stab monstatus]]", "[[low-tier stab monstatus]]", ""},
    {"monster.status_reference.6", "[[paralysed monstatus]]", "[[paralysed monstatus]]", ""},
    {"monster.status_reference.7", "[[sharing its pain monstatus]]", "[[sharing its pain monstatus]]", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.ablaze_with_memories", "This creature has temporarily gained the ability to cast specific spells.\nIt will lose access to them again once sufficiently injured.", "该生物暂时获得了施放特定法术的能力。\n一旦它伤势足够严重，就会再次失去这些法术。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.about_to_teleport", "After a short delay, this creature will be teleported to somewhere else on the\ncurrent floor.", "在短暂延迟后，该生物将被传送到当前楼层的其他某个地方。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.afflicted_by_rimeblight", "This creature suffers AC-ignoring cold damage every turn, and may sometimes\nexplode in a burst of ice that damages nearby allies. When it dies, it may\nspread rimeblight to other nearby allies.\n\nNatural, demonic, or holy creatures will be instantly killed once they reach\nlow health, and be replaced with pillars of rime.", "该生物每回合都会受到无视防护的寒系伤害，有时还会爆裂成一阵冰霜，伤害附近的盟友。它死亡时，可能会将霜疫传染给附近的其他盟友。\n\n自然、恶魔或神圣生物在生命值降低后会被立即杀死，并被霜柱取代。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.ally_target", "This creature is being targeted by one or more of your allies.", "该生物正被你的一个或多个盟友锁定为目标。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.anguished", "When this creature deals damage, it will suffer damage equal to the damage it\ndealt.", "该生物造成伤害时，会承受等同于它所造成伤害的伤害。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.berserk", "This creature has 50% more health, deals 50% more damage with melee attacks, and\nboth moves and acts 50% faster. They cannot perform any action besides moving\nor attacking.\n\nWhen the berserk rage wears off, they will be slowed and unable to berserk for a\nshort duration.", "该生物的生命值增加50%，近战攻击造成的伤害增加50%，移动和行动都加快50%。除了移动或攻击，它无法进行其他任何动作。\n\n当狂暴消退后，它会被减速，并在短时间内无法再次狂暴。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.bound_in_place", "This creature cannot move under its own power, but may still use translocations\nor be forcibly displaced by someone else.", "该生物无法靠自身力量移动，但仍可以使用移位魔法，或被他人强行移位。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.called_by_a_tesseract", "This monster has been called from a parallel reality. Killing it will grant no\nexperience points, but it will be immediately cast back to its original reality\nas soon as the tesseract is destroyed.", "这只怪物是从平行现实中召唤而来的。杀死它不会给予经验值，但超立方体一旦被摧毁，它就会被立即送回原本的现实。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.catching_its_breath", "This creature has used a breath ability recently and cannot use it again for a\nshort while.", "该生物最近使用过吐息能力，短时间内无法再次使用。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.chanting_recall", "This creature is chanting a Word of Recall. This will recall intelligent allies\nfrom elsewhere on the floor to the caster's vicinity after a short delay, but can\nbe interrupted by most effects which would normally prevent it from casting spells.", "该生物正在吟诵召回之语。这会在短暂延迟后，把当前楼层其他地方的智慧盟友召回到施法者附近，但大多数通常能阻止它施法的效果都能打断它。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.charmed", "This creature has been charmed and will fight for your cause for a short while. This\neffect will wear off immediately if you attempt to harm it in any way.", "该生物被魅惑了，会在短时间内为你的事业而战。如果你以任何方式试图伤害它，此效果都会立即消失。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.concentrated_venom", "This creature's natural venom has been intensified, giving any poison it inflicts\nthrough attacks or breath weapons a chance to slow and asphyxiate susceptible targets.", "该生物天生的毒液被强化了，使它通过攻击或吐息施加的任何毒素都有机会使易感目标减速并窒息。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.constricted_by_roots", "This creature is being constricted by tree roots, which reduces their evasion and\ninflicts some damage each turn. It may also prevent them from moving, though each\nattempt to do so has a chance to break this effect entirely.", "该生物正被树根束缚，这会降低它的闪避，并每回合造成一些伤害。它还可能会阻碍移动，不过每次尝试移动都有机会彻底打破此效果。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.constricted_by_zombie_hands", "This creature is being constricted by clutching corpses from deep beneath the\nearth, which reduces their evasion and inflicts some damage each turn. It may also\nprevent them from moving, though each attempt to do so has a chance to break this\neffect entirely.", "该生物正被来自地底深处的抓握尸骸束缚，这会降低它的闪避，并每回合造成一些伤害。它还可能会阻碍移动，不过每次尝试移动都有机会彻底打破此效果。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.contaminated", "This creature has been contaminated by transmutational energy, and will suffer\nsignificant damage every third time such energy is inflicted upon them.", "该生物受到了变化能量的污染，每第三次被施加此类能量时，都会受到大量伤害。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.control_wrested_from_you", "This formerly-friendly creature has been charmed by another creature to join their\nside. If you slay the source of this charm, it will regain its senses.", "这个原本友好的生物被另一个生物魅惑，加入了对方的阵营。如果你杀死魅惑的来源，它就会恢复理智。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.corroded", "This creature's AC is reduced by 8.", "该生物的防护降低8点。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.covered_in_liquid_flames", "This creature has been coated in sticky flame, and will take AC-ignoring fire damage\neach turn. Movement will shake off the flames, causing it to expire much more\nrapidly and stepping into water will extinguish it entirely.", "该生物被粘性火焰覆盖，每回合都会受到无视防护的火焰伤害。移动能抖落火焰，使其更快熄灭，而走进水中则能立即将火焰彻底扑灭。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.covered_in_magnetic_dust", "This creature is unable to evade attacks or turn invisible. If it dies, it will leave\nbehind a cloud of magnetised fragments.\n\nEach time Magnavolt is cast, a beam of electricity will automatically be fired at this\ncreature.", "该生物无法闪避攻击，也无法隐身。它死亡时会留下一团磁化的碎片云。\n\n每次施放磁暴电击时，都会自动向该生物射出一道电流。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.covered_in_terrible_wounds", "This creature has been afflicted with illusory wounds by a flayed ghost. These wounds\nwill disappear with time or when the flayed ghost is destroyed.", "该生物被剥皮鬼施加了虚幻的伤口。这些伤口会随时间流逝而消失，或在剥皮鬼被摧毁时消失。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.covering_ground_quickly", "This creature moves slightly faster.", "该生物的移动速度稍快。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.covering_ground_slowly", "This creature is stuck in liquefied ground, causing it to move more slowly and also\nfumble 25% of the melee attacks it makes.", "该生物被困在液化的地面中，移动更缓慢，而且它的近战攻击有25%会失手。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.crumbling_away", "This creature will be automatically destroyed in a few turns.", "该生物将在几回合后被自动摧毁。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.cursed_with_the_promise_of_agony", "This creature is cursed, and will lose half its current health after the next time\nthe source of the curse hits it with a melee attack.", "该生物被诅咒了，诅咒的来源下一次以近战攻击命中它后，它将失去当前生命值的一半。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.damage_immune_at_range", "This creature takes no damage by any means unless the original source of that\ndamage is adjacent to them. Non-damaging side-effects happen normally.\n\n(The source of damage from clouds and projectile-like monsters, such as foxfires,\nis always considered whatever creature first created them.)", "该生物不会受到任何当前不与其相邻的来源造成的伤害（包括云雾，如果其创造者并不相邻）。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.dazed", "This creature is temporarily unable to act, but any hostile action will cause it to\nimmediately regain its senses.", "该生物暂时无法行动，但任何敌对行为都会使它立即恢复理智。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.diminished_spells", "This creature's spells are less powerful - dealing less damage, being less able to\novercome their target's willpower, and occasionally being weaker in other ways.", "该生物的法术威力较弱——造成的伤害更少，更难以克服目标的意志力，偶尔还会在其他方面也更弱。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.dormant", "[[asleep monstatus]]", "[[asleep monstatus]]", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.doubled_in_vigour", "This monster's current and maximum health are temporarily doubled.", "这只怪物当前和最大的生命值暂时翻倍。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.empowered_by_the_touch_of_beogh", "This creature has been granted great power by Beogh to challenge you. Their melee\nand ranged attacks deal 33% more damage, their health is increased, and they cast\nspells more frequently. They are also able to track you, no matter where on the\ncurrent floor you flee.\n\nThey will lose these bonuses once the challenge is concluded.", "该生物被比欧弗赐予了强大的力量来挑战你。它的近战和远程攻击造成33%的额外伤害，生命值有所提升，施放法术也更加频繁。无论你逃到当前楼层的何处，它都能追踪到你。\n\n一旦挑战结束，它就会失去这些加成。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.encased_in_ice", "This creature has been flash-frozen and its movement speed is greatly reduced for\na short time.", "该生物被瞬间冻结，短时间内移动速度大幅降低。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.extremely_poisoned", "This creature suffers poison damage every turn and cannot be poisoned any\nfurther.", "该生物每回合都会受到毒素伤害，且无法再中毒更深。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.fast", "This creature moves and acts 50% faster.", "该生物的移动和行动速度加快50%。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.feeble_figment", "This creature is but a fragile duplicate of another creature. Its health is\nreduced by 66%, it deals 33% less damage with attacks, and its spells are\nsignificantly weakened.", "该生物不过是另一个生物的脆弱复制品。它的生命值减少66%，攻击造成的伤害减少33%，法术也被大幅削弱。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.flame_wreathed", "This creature has been empowered by the flames of Ignis. It deals additional\nfire damage with its melee attacks, moves 33% more quickly, and has increased AC\nand resistance to fire.", "该生物被伊格尼斯的火焰所强化。它的近战攻击会造成额外的火焰伤害，移动速度加快33%，防护和火抗都有所提升。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.fleeing", "This creature is fleeing in fear and will attempt each turn to move away from\nthe source of this fear. Beside movement, it may only cast spells which it\nthinks could help it escape, such as Blink.\n\nIf harmed directly or cornered against terrain, it will turn around to fight\nonce more.", "该生物因恐惧而逃跑，每回合都会试图远离恐惧的来源。除移动外，它只会施放它认为有助于逃跑的法术，比如闪现。\n\n如果直接受到伤害或被地形逼入绝境，它会转身再次战斗。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.fragile_as_glass", "This creature receives 50% more damage from all sources.", "该生物受到的所有来源的伤害增加50%。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.frenzied_and_wild", "This creature deals 50% more damage with melee attacks and both moves and\nattacks 50% faster. It cannot cast spells and will prioritise attacking the\nclosest other creature present each turn, whether they are friend or foe.", "该生物的近战攻击造成的伤害增加50%，移动和攻击都加快50%。它无法施放法术，每回合会优先攻击场上离它最近的其他生物，不论对方是敌是友。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.fully_charged", "This creature has gathered all the power it needs to cast its spells.", "该生物已积聚了施放法术所需的全部力量。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.grapneled", "This creature has been struck with a kinetic grapnel. The next melee attack\nfrom the grapnel's source will always hit and deal slightly increased damage.", "该生物被动能抓钩击中。抓钩来源的下一次近战攻击必定命中，并造成略微增加的伤害。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.heavily_contaminated", "[[contaminated monstatus]]", "[[contaminated monstatus]]", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.heavily_drained", "This creature has been heavily drained, lowering the accuracy of their melee\nattacks, the power of their spells and special attack properties, and making\nthem more vulnerable to many status effects.", "该生物被严重吸取，其近战攻击的命中率、法术和特殊攻击属性的威力都有所降低，并且更容易受到许多状态效果的影响。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.high_tier_stab", "<blue>Melee attacks you make against this creature will deal greatly increased damage,\nespecially if made with a short blade.</blue>", "<blue>你对该生物进行的近战攻击将造成大幅增加的伤害，尤其是使用短刃时。</blue>", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.idealised", "This creature has glows with the perfection of their best self. They deal 100%\nmore damage with melee attacks, have additional AC, and cast spells with\nsubstantially more strength.", "该生物闪耀着其最佳自我的完美光辉。它的近战攻击造成的伤害增加100%，防护有所提升，施放法术的强度也大幅增强。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.incited_by_gozag", "This creature has been roused into great speed by the wrath of Gozag Ym Sagoz.\nTheir haste or berserk state is permanent and will not wear off with time\nor through deliberate magical intervention.", "该生物被哥萨戈·亿·赛格斯的怒火激发出了极快的速度。它的加速或狂暴状态是永久的，不会随时间流逝或通过刻意的魔法干预而消退。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.indifferent", "This creature is neither hostile nor allied and may attack creatures of all\ndispositions, should it wander into them.", "该生物既非敌对也非友方，如果它游荡到其他生物身边，可能会攻击任何立场的生物。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.infested", "This creature is infested with a death scarab, which will emerge from their\nbody once they die.", "该生物体内寄生着一只死亡圣甲虫，它死后圣甲虫会从其体内钻出。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.inner_flame", "Whenever this creature suffers damage, a flame cloud will briefly appear\nbeneath them. When they die, they will explode in a violent burst of fire,\ndamaging anything nearby and leaving behind additional flame clouds.\n\nGiant creatures will trigger an even larger explosion when they die.", "每当该生物受到伤害时，其脚下都会短暂出现一团火焰云。它死亡时会猛烈爆燃，伤害附近的一切并留下额外的火焰云。\n\n巨型生物死亡时会引发更大的爆炸。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.inspiring_fear", "You are currently terrified of this creature, preventing you from deliberately\nmoving close to them and causing 33% of the melee attacks you make again\nagainst them fail.\n\nThis effect will break if you ever lose sight of this creature.", "你目前对该生物感到恐惧，这使你无法刻意靠近它，并且你针对它的近战攻击有33%会失败。\n\n一旦你与该生物断开视线，此效果就会中断。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.interlaced_with_chaos", "This creature's melee attacks may inflict additional damage of a random element\nor cause various irresistible status effects.", "该生物的近战攻击可能会造成随机元素的额外伤害，或引发各种无法抵抗的状态效果。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.lashing_out_in_frustration", "This creature has been magically vexed and is forced to attack a random adjacent\nspace each turn instead of performing any other actions. It is more likely to\nattack a space containing a creature than an empty one, but will attack its own\nallies as readily as its enemies.", "该生物被魔法激怒，每回合被迫攻击一个随机相邻的格子，而无法进行其他动作。它更可能攻击有生物的格子，而非空格，但它攻击自己的盟友和攻击敌人一样毫不犹豫。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.lightly_drained", "This creature has been lightly drained, somewhat lowering the accuracy of their\nmelee attacks, the power of their spells and special attack properties, and\nmaking them slightly more vulnerable to many status effects.", "该生物被轻度吸取，其近战攻击的命中率、法术和特殊攻击属性的威力有所降低，并且略微更容易受到许多状态效果的影响。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.lost_in_madness", "This creature has been driven to madness by the power of Zin. It will never again\nuse spells or abilities and will stumble around at random, attacking whatever\nit bumps into - be they friend or foe or sometimes even themselves.", "该生物被辛的力量逼疯了。它再也不会使用法术或能力，只会随机地四处跌撞，攻击它撞到的任何东西——不管是朋友还是敌人，有时甚至是它自己。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.low_tier_stab", "<blue>Melee attacks you make against this creature have a chance (proportional to\nyour stealth and weapon skill) of catching it off-guard and dealing\nincreased damage, especially if made with a short blade.</blue>", "<blue>你对该生物进行的近战攻击有机会（几率与你的潜行和武器技能成正比）打它个措手不及并造成更多伤害，尤其是使用短刃时。</blue>", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.magic_disrupted", "This creature's spells and magical abilities have been disrupted and may fail when\nused. The chance of failure depends on the remaining duration of this effect.", "该生物的法术和魔法能力被扰乱了，使用时可能会失败。失败几率取决于此效果的剩余持续时间。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.magic_sapped", "This creature has had its access to magic tainted. Whenever it casts a spell, its\nmagic will be severely disrupted, making it likely any subsequent spells it casts\nwill fail.", "该生物的魔法通道被污染了。每当它施放法术，它的魔法都会受到严重扰乱，使之后施放的法术很可能失败。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.marked_with_the_sign_of_ruin", "This creature has been condemned to inexorable decay and ruin. Whenever it takes\ndamage from melee attacks, it will be drained heavily and either slowed, weakened,\nor blinded.", "该生物被判定要无可避免地衰朽毁灭。每当它受到近战攻击的伤害，它都会被严重吸取，并被减速、虚弱或致盲。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.mesmerising", "This creature has mesmerised you, making you unable to voluntarily move away\nfrom them.\n\nThis effect will break if you ever lose sight of this creature.", "该生物迷住了你，使你无法主动远离它。\n\n一旦你与该生物断开视线，此效果就会中断。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.minion", "This creature has been created by magic and will cease to be once its creator dies.", "该生物由魔法创造，其创造者死亡后它就会消失。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.misshapen_and_mutated", "This creature's AC is reduced by 8 and its accuracy, spell power, brand damage, and\nwillpower are moderately reduced.", "该生物的防护降低8点，它的命中率、法术威力、附魔伤害和意志力都有中等程度的降低。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.missing_a_shadow", "This creature's shadow has been torn away from it and cannot be affected\nby Aphotic Marionette ever again.", "该生物的暗影被扯离了身体，再也无法受到无光傀儡的影响。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.more_vulnerable_to_fire", "This creature's fire resistance is reduced by one level.", "该生物的火抗降低1级。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.more_vulnerable_to_poison", "This creature's poison resistance is reduced by one level.", "该生物的毒抗降低1级。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.mute", "This creature has been stricken permanently mute by the power of Zin. This\nprevents all noise the creature could make, including the vocalisations\nrequired for most creatures to cast spells.\n# Are demons silenced\?", "该生物被辛的力量永久地变成了哑巴。这能阻止该生物发出的一切声响，包括大多数生物施法所需发出的声音。\n# 恶魔会被沉默吗？", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.paralysed_with_fear", "[[paralysed monstatus]]", "[[paralysed monstatus]]", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.partially_charged", "This creature has built up part of the charge it needs to cast a spell or\nactivate an ability.", "该生物已积累了一部分施放法术或激活能力所需的能量。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.peaceful", "This creature will never attack you and may attack other creatures hostile to\nyou, but will neither follow you nor obey any direct instructions.", "该生物永远不会攻击你，它可能会攻击与你敌对的生物，但既不会跟随你，也不会听从任何直接指令。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.poisoned", "This creature suffers poison damage every turn.", "该生物中毒了，每回合都会受到毒素伤害。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.radiating_silence", "This creature is surrounded by a field of unnatural silence which eliminates\nall noise made within it as well as preventing the vocalisations required for\nmany creatures (including you) to read scrolls, cast spells, or invoke divine\naid.\n\nIf this effect was caused by a spell, the radius of the field will shrink over\ntime.", "该生物被一片不自然的静默场域所环绕，它会消除其中发出的一切声响，并阻止许多生物（包括你）发出阅读卷轴、施放法术或祈求神助所需的声音。\n\n如果此效果由法术造成，场域的半径会随时间缩小。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.radiating_toxic_energy", "This creature shines with Olgreb's Toxic Radiance and will continuously inflict\npoison damage on all foes in sight for several turns.", "该生物闪耀着奥尔格勒布的剧毒辐射，会在数回合内持续对视线内的所有敌人造成毒素伤害。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.ready_to_become_your_apostle", "This creature has been defeated in honourable combat and may be recruited as\none of your apostles via the ability menu.", "该生物在光荣的战斗中被击败，你可以通过技能菜单将其招募为你的使徒之一。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.ready_to_howl", "This creature has not yet inflicted you with Oblivion Howl and may attempt to do so.", "该生物尚未对你施加遗忘嚎叫，它可能会尝试这么做。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.ready_to_sunder", "This creature's Sundering weapon is fully charged and its next attack will be\nmore accurate, inflict greatly increased damage, and cleave with increased range.\nThis effect will be lost if it moves.", "该生物的裂解武器已完全充能，它的下一次攻击将更加精准，造成大幅增加的伤害，并以更大的范围顺劈。如果它移动，此效果就会消失。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.reflecting_blocked_projectiles", "This creature reflects any projectile it blocks back to their original source.", "该生物会将任何它格挡下的投射物反弹回其来源。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.reflecting_injuries", "Whenever this creature suffers damage, it inflicts 2/3rds as much damage back upon\nwhatever damaged it.", "每当该生物受到伤害时，它会对伤害它的来源造成相当于该伤害2/3的伤害。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.regenerating", "This creature regenerates health at a greatly increased rate, proportion to their\nmaximum health.", "该生物恢复生命值的速度大幅提升，与其最大生命值成比例。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.repelling_missiles", "This creature has +15 EV when dodging projectiles, whether physical or magical.", "该生物在闪避投射物（无论是物理还是魔法）时获得+15闪避值。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.retreating", "This creature has been ordered to flee in a given direction, and will not attack\nor return to your side until they are given new instructions or have travelled a\nsufficient distance", "该生物被命令朝某个方向逃跑，在接到新指令或走出足够距离之前，它不会攻击，也不会回到你身边。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.rolling", "This creature has curled into a ball, increasing its movement speed and melee\ndamage by 100% until the next time it attacks something (or becomes unable to move).", "该生物蜷缩成一团，移动速度和近战伤害提升100%，直到它下一次攻击某个东西（或变得无法移动）为止。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.sharing_its_pain", "This creature will inflict a portion of all damage it suffers upon nearby allies,\nwith those closer to it receiving a greater amount.", "该生物会将自身受到的所有伤害的一部分施加给附近的盟友，距离它越近的盟友承受的越多。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.sheltered_from_injuries", "Half of the damage suffered by this creature is redirected to the ally protecting it\ninstead.", "该生物受到的一半伤害会被转嫁给保护它的盟友。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.sick", "This creature is sick and cannot naturally regenerate.", "该生物患病了，无法自然恢复生命值。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.silenced", "This creature is engulfed in a field of unnatural silence, preventing any noise\nit might make, including the vocalisations required for many creatures to cast\nspells.", "该生物被一片不自然的静默场域所吞没，使它无法发出任何声响，包括许多生物施法所需发出的声音。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.skewered_by_barbs", "This creature will take minor damage whenever it moves.", "该生物每次移动时都会受到少量伤害。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.slightly_transparent", "This creature is normally invisible, but your magical sight allows you to see it\nnonetheless. This has no effect on you, though any allies you have may not be\nable to see it as you can.", "该生物通常是隐形的，但你的魔法视力让你仍能看到它。这对你没有任何影响，但你的盟友可能无法像你一样看到它。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.slow", "This creature moves and acts at 66% of normal speed.", "该生物的移动和行动速度为正常速度的66%。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.softly_glowing", "This creature has been outlined with a halo of light and is easier to hit and\nrevealed, if invisible.", "该生物被一道光环勾勒出轮廓，更容易被击中，若其隐形则会被显形。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.soul_bound", "This creature's soul has been bound in ice. When it dies, a simulacrum of its\noriginal form will rise in its place.", "该生物的灵魂被冰封束缚。它死亡时，会在原地升起一个其原形的拟像。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.soul_gripped", "This creature's soul will be bound in service to you once they die, though\nallowing them to stray from your line of sight for more than a brief moment\nwill cause you to lose your grasp on it.", "该生物死后，它的灵魂将被束缚为你效力，不过若让它离开你的视线超过片刻，你就会失去对它的掌控。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.soul_splintered", "A fragment of this creature's soul has been extracted into a soul wisp,\npreventing further use of this spell until the wisp reunites with them again.", "该生物灵魂的一部分被抽取出来，形成了一个魂火，在该魂火与其重新会合之前，无法再次使用这个法术。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.spells_diminished", "This creature's spells are significantly weakened.", "该生物的法术被大幅削弱。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.spells_empowered", "This creature's spells are strengthened and it will cast them more frequently.", "该生物的法术得到强化，并且会更频繁地施放。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.stilling_the_winds", "This creature is preventing any clouds from being created on the current floor.", "该生物阻止了当前楼层生成任何云雾。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.strong", "This creature's melee attacks deal 50% more damage.", "该生物的近战攻击造成的伤害增加50%。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.strong_willed", "This creature's willpower is increased by 2 pips.", "该生物的意志力提升2点。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.surrounded_by_a_freezing_vortex", "This creature is the source of a devastating polar vortex.", "该生物是毁灭性极地旋涡的源头。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.surrounded_by_acidic_fog", "This creature trails a ring of acidic fog clouds around itself.", "该生物身体周围拖曳着一圈酸性雾云。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.surrounded_by_chaotic_energy", "This creature trails a ring of seething chaos clouds around itself.", "该生物身体周围拖曳着一圈翻腾的混沌云。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.surrounded_by_flames", "This creature trails a ring of flame clouds around itself.", "该生物身体周围拖曳着一圈火焰云。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.surrounded_by_fog", "This creature trails a ring of purple smoke around itself.", "该生物身体周围拖曳着一圈紫色烟雾。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.surrounded_by_foul_miasma", "This creature trails a ring of foul miasma around itself.", "该生物身体周围拖曳着一圈秽臭瘴气。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.surrounded_by_freezing_clouds", "This creature trails a ring of freezing clouds around itself.", "该生物身体周围拖曳着一圈冰寒云。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.surrounded_by_mutagenic_energy", "This creature trails a ring of mutagenic fog around itself.", "该生物身体周围拖曳着一圈诱变雾。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.surrounded_by_negative_energy", "This creature trails a ring of clouds of excruciating misery around itself.", "该生物身体周围拖曳着一圈令人极度痛苦的云。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.surrounded_by_restless_winds", "This creature has recently cast Polar Vortex and cannot cast it again for\na short time.", "该生物最近施放过极地旋涡，短时间内无法再次施放。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.surrounded_by_thunder", "This creature trails a ring of thunder clouds around itself.", "该生物身体周围拖曳着一圈雷云。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.target_of_orcish_vengeance", "This creature has contributed to the death of one of your apostles. Defeating all\ntargets of orcish vengeance will significantly speed up the time it takes for\nBeogh to resurrect your apostles.", "该生物参与害死了你的一位使徒。击败所有兽人复仇的目标，将大幅缩短比欧弗复活你的使徒所需的时间。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.targeted_by_your_dimensional_bullseye", "Whenever you perform a ranged attack aimed at a different creature, a copy of\nthe projectile will be teleported to this creature at the end of its flight.", "每当你对另一个生物进行远程攻击时，该投射物都会在飞行结束时被传送到该生物处。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.tempered", "This creature's melee attacks deal 25% more damage, its accuracy is slightly\nincreased, and its spells and abilities have been mildly strengthened.", "该生物的近战攻击造成的伤害增加25%，命中率略有提升，法术和能力也得到轻微强化。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.touched_by_paradox", "This creature has become unmoored in space, allowing it to Manifold Assault as\na natural ability. Whenever they do, there is 33% chance they will also blink\nto a random nearby location.", "该生物在空间中变得无拘无束，使它能够将多重突袭作为天生能力发动。每次发动时，它都有33%的几率同时闪现到附近的随机位置。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.unable_to_breathe", "This creature is unable to breathe and cannot cast spells or invoke divine aid.\nIt also takes minor asphyxiation damage every turn.", "该生物无法呼吸，因此无法施放法术或祈求神助。它每回合还会受到少量窒息伤害。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.unable_to_translocate", "This creature cannot blink or teleport.", "该生物无法闪现或传送。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.unaffected_by_silence", "Despite being engulfed in unnatural silence, this creature's magic does not\nrequire vocalisations and thus is unaffected.", "尽管被不自然的静默所吞没，该生物的魔法并不需要发声，因此不受影响。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.unrewarding", "This creature provides no experience or piety when slain.", "该生物被杀死时不会提供经验值或虔诚值。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.untethered_in_space", "Each turn, this creature blinks a short distance further away from you and\nsuffers a small amount of damage.", "每回合，该生物都会闪现到离你稍远一点的地方，并受到少量伤害。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.unusually_agile", "This creature's evasion is slightly increased.", "该生物的闪避略有提升。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.unusually_resistant", "This creature's resistance to fire, cold, poison, electricity, and corrosion\nare all increased by one level.", "该生物对火、寒、毒、电和酸蚀的抗性都提升1级。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.very_poisoned", "This creature is poisoned and will take damage every turn.", "该生物中毒较深，每回合都会受到毒素伤害。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.weak", "This creature's melee attacks deal 33% less damage.", "该生物的近战攻击造成的伤害减少33%。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.weak_willed", "This creature's willpower is reduced by half.", "该生物的意志力减半。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.winding_a_clockwork_bee", "This creature is preparing to launch a clockwork bee and must focus on this\ntask for several turns. Most effects that would prevent this creature from\ncasting spells will also interrupt this process.", "该生物正准备发射一只发条蜂，必须在数回合内专注于这项任务。大多数能阻止该生物施法的效果也能打断这个过程。", ""},
    {"monster.status_text.withering_away", "This creature will die in a few turns.\n## Not real statuses, but common clauses to add to some others", "该生物将在几回合内死亡。\n## 以下并非真正的状态，而是用于添加到某些状态中的常见条款。", ""},
