    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's melee attacks deal 50% more damage.", "monster.status_text.strong"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's melee attacks may inflict additional damage of a random element\nor cause various irresistible status effects.", "monster.status_text.interlaced_with_chaos"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's natural venom has been intensified, giving any poison it inflicts\nthrough attacks or breath weapons a chance to slow and asphyxiate susceptible targets.", "monster.status_text.concentrated_venom"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's poison resistance is reduced by one level.", "monster.status_text.more_vulnerable_to_poison"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's resistance to fire, cold, poison, electricity, and corrosion\nare all increased by one level.", "monster.status_text.unusually_resistant"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's shadow has been torn away from it and cannot be affected\nby Aphotic Marionette ever again.", "monster.status_text.missing_a_shadow"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's soul has been bound in ice. When it dies, a simulacrum of its\noriginal form will rise in its place.", "monster.status_text.soul_bound"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's soul will be bound in service to you once they die, though\nallowing them to stray from your line of sight for more than a brief moment\nwill cause you to lose your grasp on it.", "monster.status_text.soul_gripped"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's spells and magical abilities have been disrupted and may fail when\nused. The chance of failure depends on the remaining duration of this effect.", "monster.status_text.magic_disrupted"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's spells are less powerful - dealing less damage, being less able to\novercome their target's willpower, and occasionally being weaker in other ways.", "monster.status_text.diminished_spells"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's spells are significantly weakened.", "monster.status_text.spells_diminished"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's spells are strengthened and it will cast them more frequently.", "monster.status_text.spells_empowered"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's willpower is increased by 2 pips.", "monster.status_text.strong_willed"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This creature's willpower is reduced by half.", "monster.status_text.weak_willed"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This formerly-friendly creature has been charmed by another creature to join their\nside. If you slay the source of this charm, it will regain its senses.", "monster.status_text.control_wrested_from_you"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This monster has been called from a parallel reality. Killing it will grant no\nexperience points, but it will be immediately cast back to its original reality\nas soon as the tesseract is destroyed.", "monster.status_text.called_by_a_tesseract"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "This monster's current and maximum health are temporarily doubled.", "monster.status_text.doubled_in_vigour"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "When this creature deals damage, it will suffer damage equal to the damage it\ndealt.", "monster.status_text.anguished"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "Whenever this creature suffers damage, a flame cloud will briefly appear\nbeneath them. When they die, they will explode in a violent burst of fire,\ndamaging anything nearby and leaving behind additional flame clouds.\n\nGiant creatures will trigger an even larger explosion when they die.", "monster.status_text.inner_flame"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "Whenever this creature suffers damage, it inflicts 2/3rds as much damage back upon\nwhatever damaged it.", "monster.status_text.reflecting_injuries"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "Whenever you perform a ranged attack aimed at a different creature, a copy of\nthe projectile will be teleported to this creature at the end of its flight.", "monster.status_text.targeted_by_your_dimensional_bullseye"},
    {"detail.monster.status_text", "You are currently terrified of this creature, preventing you from deliberately\nmoving close to them and causing 33% of the melee attacks you make again\nagainst them fail.\n\nThis effect will break if you ever lose sight of this creature.", "monster.status_text.inspiring_fear"},
