    {"hints.pickup", "That <console>$1 </console>is an item. If you move there and press <input>$cmd[CMD_PICKUP]</input><localtiles>, or <input>left-click</input> on it in your inventory</localtiles>, you will pick it up.<console> Generally, items are shown by non-letter symbols like <w>%\?!\"=()[</w>.</console> Some objects<tiles>, marked with a green frame,</tiles> will be picked up automatically.\n\nOnce it is in your inventory, you can drop it again with <localtiles>a <input>Shift-left-click</input>. Whenever you <input>right-click</input> on an item</localtiles><console><input>$cmd[CMD_DROP]</input>. Any time you look at an item in your inventory (<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_INVENTORY]</input>)</console>, you can read about its properties and its description.\n", "hints.pickup.first_object"},
